BikeTube

The speed calculation in BikeMath.java is adapted from OpenRide's
PelotonSpeed.kt by digitalducktape, licensed under Apache License 2.0.
It has been converted to Java with input validation and display unit conversion.
https://github.com/digitalducktape/OpenRide

The underlying power to speed model was reverse engineered by Imran Haque
in PeloMon. Grupetto by selalipop demonstrated a system-wide bike metrics
overlay. These projects informed the interoperability work.
https://ihaque.org/posts/2020/12/25/pelomon-part-ib-computing-speed/
https://github.com/selalipop/grupetto

The Gradle wrapper is distributed under Apache License 2.0.
The repository includes no Peloton APKs, firmware, or decompiled source.
